WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:18.249
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:18.519 --> 01:19.959
Right, just look at the camera.

3
01:20.319 --> 01:22.000
My name is Qian Yichuan.

4
01:23.159 --> 01:24.159
The "Yi" of chivalry and honor,

5
01:24.920 --> 01:26.040
and "Chuan" for rivers flowing to the sea.

6
01:28.120 --> 01:29.079
I'm...

7
01:30.480 --> 01:31.400
an accountant in the finance department.

8
01:32.640 --> 01:33.159
That's all.

9
01:33.480 --> 01:35.879
I hear you're a college graduate.

10
01:36.200 --> 01:36.680
That's right.

11
01:37.000 --> 01:38.079
Graduated from the Business University.

12
01:38.560 --> 01:39.640
Why come to Lapi Brewery?

13
01:40.359 --> 01:41.599
Why wouldn't I come to Lapi Brewery?

14
01:44.439 --> 01:45.359
My father

15
01:45.840 --> 01:47.079
worked at Lapi Brewery, too.

16
01:49.120 --> 01:50.079
He was a factory worker.

17
01:51.200 --> 01:53.680
He got sick and died during my senior year.

18
01:54.879 --> 01:55.680
After that,

19
01:56.959 --> 01:58.400
it was the factory uncles and elders

20
01:58.920 --> 02:01.280
who pooled money to put me through college.

21
02:02.959 --> 02:04.120
I'm a child of Lapi.

22
02:05.120 --> 02:05.959
After graduating,

23
02:06.319 --> 02:08.039
I had to return to Lapi and do my part.

24
02:09.039 --> 02:10.000
I have a dream.

25
02:12.319 --> 02:13.360
I hope that one day,

26
02:14.120 --> 02:15.319
people all around the world

27
02:15.800 --> 02:17.639
will get to drink our Lapi beer.

28
02:18.960 --> 02:19.599
That's great.

29
02:20.159 --> 02:20.840
Thank you.

30
02:23.479 --> 02:24.759
Your glasses have a bit of glare.

31
02:25.280 --> 02:25.639
My glasses?

32
02:25.639 --> 02:26.680
This is Tu from our finance department.

33
02:26.719 --> 02:27.759
Why don't you interview her?

34
02:27.759 --> 02:28.800
Drink some water and shut it, will you?

35
02:29.800 --> 02:30.360
You're so annoying.

36
02:30.919 --> 02:31.560
Say a few words!

37
02:31.639 --> 02:32.400
Chunyan, say a few words.

38
02:32.400 --> 02:33.280
It's not an interview. Just say something.

39
02:33.400 --> 02:34.680
Weren't you interviewing the college grad?

40
02:35.159 --> 02:36.039
What's your dream?

41
02:39.639 --> 02:40.960
My dream is...

42
02:41.639 --> 02:43.159
to get into college in my next life,

43
02:43.759 --> 02:44.919
just like Qian Yichuan.

44
02:47.599 --> 02:48.120
I...

45
02:48.400 --> 02:51.960
I hope to have what it takes to be chief,

46
02:52.479 --> 02:53.520
and manage our factory well.

47
02:53.919 --> 02:55.159
Those last two lines were his dream,

48
02:56.240 --> 02:57.199
not mine.

49
02:57.680 --> 02:58.479
Didn't you say

50
02:58.520 --> 03:00.080
you wanted to be the top dog in finance?

51
03:00.680 --> 03:01.719
Stop talking about me!

52
04:38.879 --> 04:39.839
This thing's pretty amazing.

53
04:39.920 --> 04:41.040
Gotta admit, it works.

54
04:41.160 --> 04:41.800
How so?

55
04:42.519 --> 04:44.000
If it worked, would I be lying here?

56
04:45.079 --> 04:46.040
How didn't it work?

57
04:46.160 --> 04:47.199
Those other guys are all dead,

58
04:47.199 --> 04:48.000
and you're still breathing.

59
04:48.199 --> 04:49.000
Get it?

60
04:50.720 --> 04:52.519
You're grinning like an idiot.

61
05:00.439 --> 05:01.279
I came to visit you.

62
05:09.600 --> 05:10.800
Get me a jar of canned yellow peaches.

63
05:17.759 --> 05:18.399
A small jar, okay?

64
05:18.399 --> 05:19.160
I can't finish a big one.

65
05:36.360 --> 05:37.279
How are you feeling?

66
05:38.079 --> 05:38.959
What's this?

67
05:40.480 --> 05:41.360
Got the word

68
05:42.079 --> 05:43.079
and came to mourn me?

69
05:44.600 --> 05:45.160
I'm alright.

70
05:45.680 --> 05:46.279
Still alive.

71
05:46.399 --> 05:46.959
Not dead yet.

72
05:50.759 --> 05:51.480
Old Qian.

73
05:53.199 --> 05:54.759
I've always owed you an apology.

74
06:00.519 --> 06:02.040
All these years, I've kept having dreams.

75
06:03.040 --> 06:03.639
Dreaming of

76
06:04.480 --> 06:05.759
the days when I first came to the factory.

77
06:07.199 --> 06:08.920
The director asked what I wanted to film.

78
06:09.680 --> 06:10.360
I said,

79
06:11.480 --> 06:13.000
I wanted to film everyone's smiles.

80
06:15.920 --> 06:16.959
Genuine smiles.

81
06:31.120 --> 06:31.920
Back then,

82
06:33.680 --> 06:34.639
I was just

83
06:36.920 --> 06:38.639
a young reporter aiming for the truth.

84
06:40.720 --> 06:41.720
You were

85
06:42.160 --> 06:44.199
an accountant trying to make your mark

86
06:44.199 --> 06:45.319
at Lacheng's First State Factory.

87
06:48.360 --> 06:50.000
We both uncovered a terrifying reality,

88
06:50.480 --> 06:52.079
one far beyond our control.

89
06:53.480 --> 06:54.759
But we both took the plunge anyway.

90
06:56.639 --> 06:57.360
So

91
06:58.360 --> 06:59.480
we're the same kind of person.

92
07:00.800 --> 07:02.519
Maybe back then, who knows?

93
07:05.160 --> 07:06.279
But right now,

94
07:10.279 --> 07:11.920
you're a big director in Beijing,

95
07:14.279 --> 07:16.319
and I'm just a watchdog in the factory.

96
07:22.360 --> 07:23.279
To tell you the truth,

97
07:24.079 --> 07:25.600
I haven't had it easy out there.

98
07:27.000 --> 07:28.560
It might look glamorous to outsiders,

99
07:29.519 --> 07:30.360
but it's all an illusion.

100
07:31.720 --> 07:32.920
When I first left,

101
07:33.920 --> 07:36.000
I was full of hope and big dreams.

102
07:37.079 --> 07:38.759
I wanted to join the biggest network

103
07:38.959 --> 07:40.560
as an investigative journalist.

104
07:41.240 --> 07:42.600
But after all these years,

105
07:45.600 --> 07:47.240
I couldn't even get into that department.

106
07:48.399 --> 07:49.680
Bouncing from one show to another,

107
07:50.399 --> 07:51.759
doing odd, menial jobs.

108
07:54.920 --> 07:56.160
Finally scraped together some cash

109
07:56.199 --> 07:56.959
to make a film,

110
07:57.399 --> 07:58.480
only to end up buried in debt.

111
08:02.360 --> 08:03.480
Honestly,

112
08:06.800 --> 08:08.959
I've given up on those dreams.

113
08:12.480 --> 08:13.839
Coming back this time, I just wanted

114
08:13.959 --> 08:15.240
to sell my place here,

115
08:16.079 --> 08:17.079
pay off the bulk of my debts,

116
08:17.759 --> 08:18.959
quit journalism for good,

117
08:19.439 --> 08:20.279
find any random job

118
08:20.279 --> 08:21.160
just to get by,

119
08:22.000 --> 08:23.240
and call it a life.

120
08:24.800 --> 08:25.720
I don't know

121
08:28.480 --> 08:30.279
what these years were all for,

122
08:32.039 --> 08:32.960
nor do I know

123
08:34.720 --> 08:35.639
what my future holds.

124
08:36.840 --> 08:37.639
Just like you,

125
08:39.120 --> 08:39.799
I'm completely lost.

126
08:43.840 --> 08:45.240
Don't drag me into this.

127
08:46.600 --> 08:47.600
I'm not lost at all.

128
08:49.200 --> 08:49.759
What's your deal, anyway?

129
08:49.799 --> 08:50.480
Standing there today,

130
08:50.519 --> 08:51.679
rattling on and on—

131
08:52.600 --> 08:54.000
did you come here to see who has it worse?

132
09:10.759 --> 09:11.360
Sure.

133
09:11.720 --> 09:12.600
Come on, let's go again.

134
09:15.159 --> 09:15.759
Get out, quick.

135
09:22.000 --> 09:22.559
Where are you going?

136
09:22.600 --> 09:23.480
Yan'er, come outside with me.

137
09:23.720 --> 09:24.399
What for?

138
09:24.480 --> 09:25.559
Just come outside with me.

139
09:25.960 --> 09:26.879
Go on out.

140
09:27.519 --> 09:28.840
The men are talking. Why are you here?

141
09:29.919 --> 09:31.080
Don't drag me!

142
09:31.720 --> 09:32.919
It's fine. Don't worry.

143
09:35.960 --> 09:36.720
Qian Yichuan.

144
09:37.799 --> 09:39.519
Heard you're scheming behind our backs.

145
09:42.080 --> 09:42.840
Failed to win the factory at the auction,

146
09:42.840 --> 09:43.480
and what?

147
09:43.639 --> 09:44.399
Can't accept it?

148
09:45.200 --> 09:46.080
Of course I can't.

149
09:46.200 --> 09:47.120
What's there not to accept?

150
09:48.080 --> 09:49.240
The state's Restructuring this time

151
09:50.000 --> 09:50.799
wasn't meant to abandon us

152
09:50.799 --> 09:51.919
and leave us to fend for ourselves.

153
09:52.879 --> 09:54.320
It's to motivate all of us

154
09:54.679 --> 09:55.840
to seek a better future.

155
09:58.360 --> 09:59.399
What do you call a better future?

156
10:00.480 --> 10:02.120
Do you need someone who loves the factory,

157
10:02.120 --> 10:03.080
has real management skills,

158
10:03.159 --> 10:04.879
and can bring everyone together,

159
10:05.279 --> 10:05.840
or do you want someone

160
10:05.879 --> 10:07.600
who abuses power and breaks the law?

161
10:08.080 --> 10:08.879
What's going on?

162
10:09.360 --> 10:10.879
Why did you bring so many people?

163
10:14.720 --> 10:15.200
Leizi.

164
10:16.799 --> 10:18.080
We grew up together.

165
10:19.080 --> 10:20.120
Inside this factory yard,

166
10:21.039 --> 10:21.799
playing marbles,

167
10:22.600 --> 10:23.399
playing hide-and-seek.

168
10:24.559 --> 10:25.320
Tell me,

169
10:25.840 --> 10:27.519
all our relatives and neighbors here,

170
10:27.879 --> 10:29.039
aren't they all workers of this factory?

171
10:30.320 --> 10:31.840
Don't you love this factory?

172
10:33.480 --> 10:34.080
I do.

173
10:35.320 --> 10:37.320
Don't you want this factory to thrive?

174
10:39.919 --> 10:40.960
I do.

175
10:42.120 --> 10:43.720
It's just like choosing a parent.

176
10:45.360 --> 10:46.720
If we pick the wrong parent,

177
10:49.519 --> 10:50.720
we'll end up like orphans,

178
10:51.480 --> 10:53.120
starving and freezing to death.

179
10:53.360 --> 10:54.480
Am I wrong?

180
11:04.480 --> 11:05.720
You sure can run your mouth.

181
11:07.279 --> 11:08.679
I only heard about it before,

182
11:10.279 --> 11:11.519
but today I heard it myself.

183
11:13.080 --> 11:13.679
Saw it with my own eyes.

184
11:15.960 --> 11:17.559
You think you know it all, Qian Yichuan?

185
11:18.679 --> 11:20.639
Duped those who didn't know better, huh?

186
11:22.000 --> 11:23.639
Confusing those who actually did.

187
11:28.799 --> 11:30.039
I'm asking you just one thing today.

188
11:30.919 --> 11:31.600
From now on,

189
11:32.519 --> 11:33.600
can you keep that foul mouth shut?

190
11:33.639 --> 11:34.639
No.

191
11:40.519 --> 11:41.960
Are you begging for a beating?

192
11:42.600 --> 11:44.000
What would you do with this factory?

193
11:44.840 --> 11:45.840
If given the chance,

194
11:47.480 --> 11:49.159
I'd make a great manager.

195
11:49.919 --> 11:51.559
Give you an inch, and you take a mile!

196
11:55.600 --> 11:56.720
Just give me your word right now:

197
11:56.840 --> 11:58.679
all that crap you spewed was bullshit,

198
11:58.720 --> 11:59.200
and you were just talking drunk.

199
11:59.200 --> 12:00.000
You're full of shit!

200
12:03.279 --> 12:04.000
So you want to do this the hard way!

201
12:04.000 --> 12:05.200
I'm the one cutting you some slack here!

202
12:05.759 --> 12:06.840
Listen up, all of you!

203
12:07.080 --> 12:07.679
Let me tell you,

204
12:08.120 --> 12:09.480
I have all the evidence

205
12:09.559 --> 12:10.960
of Ma Guowen's crimes in my hands!

206
12:11.360 --> 12:12.639
The moment I hand this over,

207
12:12.720 --> 12:13.720
not just Ma Guowen,

208
12:15.960 --> 12:16.879
but every single one of you lapdogs,

209
12:17.120 --> 12:18.399
none of you will get away!

210
12:18.480 --> 12:19.080
Get him!

211
12:19.120 --> 12:19.799
Screw you!

212
12:21.879 --> 12:22.480
Beat him!

213
12:27.879 --> 12:28.600
Get off me!

214
12:31.480 --> 12:32.360
Stop!

215
12:33.600 --> 12:34.200
Keep hitting him!

216
12:47.879 --> 12:48.360
Leizi!

217
12:48.360 --> 12:49.840
Leizi, darn you!

218
12:50.000 --> 12:50.679
Touch him again...

219
12:50.960 --> 12:51.559
Get lost!

220
13:04.039 --> 13:04.759
It's okay now.

221
13:08.559 --> 13:09.159
Let's go.

222
13:21.639 --> 13:22.840
Iron Crutch Li

223
13:24.279 --> 13:25.440
Clubfoot Seven

224
13:26.879 --> 13:28.080
Crippled Foot

225
13:29.360 --> 13:30.279
Cripple Qian

226
13:32.000 --> 13:33.320
Anyway, from that day on,

227
13:34.559 --> 13:35.919
no one called me Qian Yichuan anymore.

228
13:40.080 --> 13:41.200
But at least that day...

229
13:46.320 --> 13:47.559
I didn't bow my head.

230
13:56.279 --> 13:56.919
Old Qian...

231
13:58.799 --> 13:59.559
I respect you.

232
14:02.200 --> 14:03.440
If it were me,

233
14:05.559 --> 14:06.639
I don't know how I'd have ended up.

234
14:19.600 --> 14:20.200
What's the matter?

235
14:21.679 --> 14:22.960
Actually tearing up?

236
14:25.919 --> 14:27.399
What are you crying for?

237
14:28.600 --> 14:29.960
Even in my condition, I'm hanging tough.

238
14:29.960 --> 14:31.399
You... you've got all your limbs.

239
14:31.399 --> 14:32.639
What are you crying over there for?

240
14:34.440 --> 14:35.799
If you're out of money, just earn more.

241
14:35.799 --> 14:37.159
Money is nothing, let me tell you.

242
14:38.519 --> 14:40.159
Keeping your chin up is what matters most.

243
14:40.200 --> 14:41.399
You've gotta keep your spirits up.

244
14:41.519 --> 14:42.960
A person needs some backbone, you know?

245
14:47.720 --> 14:49.399
Chunyan and I are heading to Sanya soon.

246
14:49.960 --> 14:50.639
Go swimming.

247
14:50.759 --> 14:51.480
Soak up the sun.

248
14:53.000 --> 14:53.679
Right?

249
14:56.759 --> 14:57.440
So goodbye,

250
14:59.960 --> 15:00.559
and never see you again.

251
15:18.320 --> 15:19.039
Goodbye

252
15:33.919 --> 15:34.600
Oh, man!

253
15:35.000 --> 15:35.759
Looking so handsome!

254
15:36.159 --> 15:36.720
Sharp!

255
15:38.320 --> 15:39.080
You happy with it?

256
15:39.320 --> 15:40.399
How could I not be?

257
15:40.559 --> 15:41.440
Love it!

258
15:41.559 --> 15:42.759
With this haircut,

259
15:44.960 --> 15:45.720
do I look like an accountant?

260
15:49.559 --> 15:50.159
All set.

261
15:50.440 --> 15:51.080
All done.

262
15:51.480 --> 15:52.159
How much is it?

263
15:52.559 --> 15:53.080
Twenty.

264
15:53.559 --> 15:54.960
No discount, buddy?

265
15:55.200 --> 15:56.159
Call it 15.

266
15:56.600 --> 15:57.200
Great!

267
15:57.279 --> 15:58.080
Fifteen, exact change.

268
15:58.080 --> 15:58.639
Thank you!

269
15:58.759 --> 15:59.360
You're welcome.

270
15:59.600 --> 16:00.000
Come on.

271
16:03.080 --> 16:04.000
I want to go somewhere...

272
16:04.000 --> 16:04.799
...to say goodbye.

273
16:07.279 --> 16:08.000
Where to?

274
16:08.600 --> 16:09.120
Guess.

275
16:12.120 --> 16:13.600
Don't tell me it's where we first—

276
16:15.919 --> 16:16.679
What are you doing?

277
16:17.120 --> 16:17.720
People are watching!

278
16:17.879 --> 16:18.759
What's there to be afraid of?

279
16:18.759 --> 16:19.720
Who hasn't been in love?

280
16:19.879 --> 16:21.080
Doesn't the barber date too?

281
16:21.639 --> 16:22.279
Are we a good match?

282
16:22.480 --> 16:22.919
A great match.

283
16:23.919 --> 16:25.200
All right, put it on.

284
16:27.360 --> 16:27.759
Let's go.

285
16:29.080 --> 16:29.519
Your hair!

286
16:33.120 --> 16:33.600
Let's go.

287
16:33.799 --> 16:34.200
Come on.

288
16:34.559 --> 16:35.320
Hold onto me.

289
16:35.320 --> 16:35.799
Holding on, holding on.

290
16:35.799 --> 16:36.279
Holding you tight.

291
16:38.799 --> 16:40.600
Liu Xuemei's son is named Liu Xiaosheng.

292
16:41.399 --> 16:42.200
He works in broadband.

293
16:42.879 --> 16:44.159
He's right in Lacheng.

294
16:44.440 --> 16:45.759
I managed to get his phone number.

295
16:46.200 --> 16:47.320
I'll send it to your WeChat in a bit.

296
16:49.519 --> 16:50.320
Contact him.

297
16:50.960 --> 16:51.840
Be sure to meet with him.

298
16:52.399 --> 16:53.440
No problem, I'll get in touch.

299
16:55.919 --> 16:57.720
No idea what Sister Miao caught wind of,

300
16:57.960 --> 16:58.639
but she keeps asking around.

301
17:00.120 --> 17:00.799
She says...

302
17:01.279 --> 17:03.000
if you're willing to work with her,

303
17:03.679 --> 17:05.000
you can name your price.

304
17:06.000 --> 17:07.319
I have no intention of working with her.

305
17:07.960 --> 17:09.079
Don't tell her a thing.

306
17:09.400 --> 17:10.720
I wouldn't dare without your say-so.

307
17:14.799 --> 17:16.119
If we're going to do this,

308
17:16.799 --> 17:18.880
we need to find someone reliable,

309
17:19.559 --> 17:20.799
a credible organization.

310
17:21.839 --> 17:24.160
Reliable and credible...

311
17:24.359 --> 17:25.200
Going with a TV station

312
17:25.240 --> 17:26.200
might be more dependable.

313
17:28.000 --> 17:28.880
Only thing is,

314
17:29.559 --> 17:30.119
the money...

315
17:30.119 --> 17:31.480
won't be as much as public accounts pay.

316
17:32.319 --> 17:34.119
I never planned on making money off this.

317
17:35.920 --> 17:37.240
Much respect.

318
17:37.759 --> 17:38.160
Cheers to you.

319
17:41.079 --> 17:41.839
I've got a lot to learn from you.

320
17:43.119 --> 17:44.160
I can't quite remember it.

321
17:45.039 --> 17:46.480
The first line went something like...

322
17:46.799 --> 17:47.440
I know!

323
17:48.480 --> 17:50.000
"Thugs in the pool hall picked a fight,"

324
17:50.000 --> 17:50.359
Right.

325
17:51.039 --> 17:52.640
"Left poor Chuanzi in a daze."

326
17:53.720 --> 17:55.480
"Tu Chunyan flew in through the air,"

327
17:55.880 --> 17:57.880
"And knocked down the whole damn bunch!"

328
17:58.839 --> 18:01.359
What, want me to get you glasses tomorrow?

329
18:02.160 --> 18:02.680
This door...

330
18:03.599 --> 18:04.720
I could open it with my eyes closed.

331
18:07.799 --> 18:09.519
Opened it with your eyes closed indeed!

332
18:10.640 --> 18:11.079
Let's go.

333
18:19.559 --> 18:20.640
What were you thinking,

334
18:20.759 --> 18:22.359
insisting on visiting the factory again?

335
18:22.559 --> 18:23.640
I'm leaving soon.

336
18:23.640 --> 18:25.039
Not sure if I'll ever come back.

337
18:25.480 --> 18:26.319
Just want to take a look,

338
18:26.880 --> 18:27.799
for old times' sake.

339
18:28.200 --> 18:29.960
Leave it to an educated guy like you.

340
18:36.160 --> 18:37.079
I'll send Liu Xiaosheng's number

341
18:37.079 --> 18:38.160
to your phone.

342
18:39.720 --> 18:40.240
Hello?

343
18:40.480 --> 18:40.960
Hello?

344
18:42.559 --> 18:43.279
Leshui?

345
18:44.319 --> 18:45.039
It's Qian Yichuan.

346
18:46.440 --> 18:47.079
Old Qian.

347
18:47.880 --> 18:48.599
Are you free?

348
18:48.599 --> 18:49.680
I want to talk to you about the case.

349
18:50.720 --> 18:51.240
Sure.

350
18:51.880 --> 18:52.640
Where should I meet you?

351
18:53.079 --> 18:53.880
I'm at the old factory.

352
18:53.880 --> 18:54.839
Let's meet at the gate soon.

353
18:55.440 --> 18:56.240
How long will it take?

354
18:56.880 --> 18:57.680
I'm heading over right now.

355
18:57.960 --> 18:58.440
Wait for me.

356
18:58.880 --> 18:59.400
All right.

357
19:00.039 --> 19:01.039
Chunyan and I

358
19:01.039 --> 19:03.960
will stroll up to the malt silo first.

359
19:04.160 --> 19:04.960
Talk to you when you get here.

360
19:05.119 --> 19:05.799
Call me.

361
19:06.319 --> 19:06.759
Will do.

362
19:13.839 --> 19:15.519
Haven't been up there in ages.

363
19:29.880 --> 19:31.599
Still pretty nimble on your feet!

364
19:34.400 --> 19:34.839
Not bad.

365
19:35.079 --> 19:35.759
Take it slow, it's slippery.

366
19:35.759 --> 19:36.240
Here.

367
19:37.039 --> 19:39.039
Easy does it, Master Qian.

368
19:39.640 --> 19:40.640
Man...

369
19:42.319 --> 19:43.200
I think you're...

370
19:43.480 --> 19:44.200
doing pretty well.

371
19:46.680 --> 19:48.200
Haven't been up here in ages.

372
19:49.359 --> 19:50.240
Now that we're up here...

373
19:50.240 --> 19:51.000
it hits me...

374
19:52.400 --> 19:54.759
just how huge our factory really is.

375
19:56.680 --> 19:57.640
Yeah.

376
19:59.039 --> 19:59.839
It's huge...

377
20:00.799 --> 20:01.519
and old.

378
20:03.319 --> 20:04.119
A lot of people spend their whole lives...

379
20:04.119 --> 20:05.640
without ever leaving this place.

380
20:14.960 --> 20:15.880
Don't talk nonsense.

381
20:16.039 --> 20:17.599
Remember the first time we came up here?

382
20:20.119 --> 20:20.799
Don't bring that up.

383
20:20.799 --> 20:22.640
You told me, "Qian Yichuan, I'm cold."

384
20:23.359 --> 20:24.960
La-la-la, I'm not listening!

385
20:25.240 --> 20:26.759
So I took off my coat and gave it to you.

386
20:27.519 --> 20:29.240
You said, "Qian Yichuan, I'm still cold."

387
20:29.240 --> 20:30.160
You're so annoying!

388
20:30.160 --> 20:31.640
So I took off my shirt for you too.

389
20:33.079 --> 20:34.759
You said, "Qian Yichuan, my legs are cold."

390
20:35.279 --> 20:36.119
Shut up already!

391
21:03.880 --> 21:04.720
Qian Yichuan.

392
21:05.160 --> 21:05.759
Hello,

393
21:06.279 --> 21:08.400
the number you dialed is powered off.

394
21:08.720 --> 21:09.160
Sorry.

395
21:27.480 --> 21:28.079
Officer Han,

396
21:28.759 --> 21:30.440
Qian Yichuan wanted to see me.

397
21:30.720 --> 21:32.319
He asked to meet by the old factory gate.

398
21:32.960 --> 21:34.079
I'm here right now,

399
21:34.400 --> 21:35.440
but I don't see him.

400
21:36.319 --> 21:37.319
His phone isn't going through either.

401
21:37.640 --> 21:38.559
How could you go out this late,

402
21:38.559 --> 21:40.279
all alone to such a dangerous place?

403
21:40.279 --> 21:41.599
Get out of there right now!

404
21:42.319 --> 21:43.680
He said it's related to the case.

405
21:44.079 --> 21:45.880
No matter what, you shouldn't have gone!

406
21:46.240 --> 21:47.640
That old factory is so dangerous!

407
21:47.960 --> 21:48.880
Leave right now.

408
21:48.880 --> 21:49.720
Go home.

409
21:50.079 --> 21:51.799
Text me when you get home, okay?

410
21:52.200 --> 21:53.079
I'll head over in a bit.

411
21:53.400 --> 21:54.119
I'll help you look for him.

412
21:54.119 --> 21:54.599
All right?

413
21:54.599 --> 21:55.880
I'll call you once I find him.

414
21:56.200 --> 21:56.759
Don't worry.

415
21:57.680 --> 21:58.319
Okay.

416
22:05.200 --> 22:06.559
Let's head over to the old factory.

417
22:06.920 --> 22:07.759
You two come with me.

418
22:08.079 --> 22:08.480
Let's move.

419
22:31.839 --> 22:32.359
Hello?

420
22:33.119 --> 22:33.799
Shen Leshui.

421
22:34.319 --> 22:35.000
Where are you?

422
22:35.480 --> 22:36.400
I'm in the car.

423
22:36.599 --> 22:37.640
Didn't you tell me to head back?

424
22:38.279 --> 22:38.880
Good, head home.

425
22:39.240 --> 22:41.400
My men and I are at the old factory gate.

426
22:41.680 --> 22:42.759
Then I'll come meet you.

427
22:42.920 --> 22:43.759
Don't come back.

428
22:44.960 --> 22:46.279
I'll go track down Qian Yichuan.

429
22:55.039 --> 22:55.880
You two go right.

430
22:56.680 --> 22:57.279
I'll take the front.

431
22:57.400 --> 22:57.799
Okay.

432
22:57.799 --> 22:59.240
Report anything immediately.

433
22:59.400 --> 22:59.920
Copy that.

434
23:00.079 --> 23:00.799
Stay safe.

435
23:00.799 --> 23:01.240
Let's move.

436
23:01.759 --> 23:02.240
Driver,

437
23:02.960 --> 23:03.839
turn around and head back.

438
23:38.880 --> 23:40.119
Xiao Wu, Wenxiu.

439
23:40.480 --> 23:41.319
Copy that, copy that.

440
23:42.279 --> 23:43.680
By the malt silo in the old factory,

441
23:44.160 --> 23:45.200
there's been a murder.

442
23:45.880 --> 23:46.680
Requesting backup.

443
23:46.799 --> 23:47.279
Copy that.

444
24:57.880 --> 24:58.440
Who is it?

445
24:58.680 --> 24:59.359
Qian Yichuan.

446
25:21.319 --> 25:21.799
Chuang!

447
25:22.079 --> 25:23.160
We're at the bottom of the malt silo!

448
25:23.400 --> 25:24.000
At the bottom of the malt silo, Chuang!

449
25:24.079 --> 25:24.599
Where are you?

450
25:24.599 --> 25:25.200
Chuang, over there!

451
25:25.200 --> 25:25.799
Where are you?

452
25:25.839 --> 25:26.279
Over there!

453
25:26.279 --> 25:26.920
Hey, Chuang!

454
25:27.319 --> 25:27.960
Hey, Chuang!

455
25:28.759 --> 25:29.640
Xiao Wu, wait here.

456
25:29.640 --> 25:29.960
Okay.

457
25:31.880 --> 25:32.720
Hey, Chuang!

458
25:32.799 --> 25:33.640
Hey, Chuang!

459
25:34.119 --> 25:34.880
Chuang!

460
25:35.119 --> 25:35.680
Chuang!

461
25:39.759 --> 25:40.400
Chuang!

462
26:13.279 --> 26:14.000
Xiao Wu.

463
26:16.079 --> 26:16.680
Where's Chuang?

464
26:17.079 --> 26:17.599
Over there.

465
26:17.920 --> 26:18.599
Xiao Gao.

466
26:18.839 --> 26:19.599
Chuang's over here!

467
26:19.599 --> 26:20.119
What's the situation?

468
26:20.480 --> 26:21.680
Someone fell from up high over there.

469
26:21.880 --> 26:22.839
No vital signs.

470
26:23.079 --> 26:24.240
A black plastic bag is over the head.

471
26:26.759 --> 26:27.319
Chuang!

472
26:29.640 --> 26:30.440
What happened to him?

473
26:30.440 --> 26:31.160
Is that Han Chuang?

474
26:32.079 --> 26:32.720
Captain Cheng!

475
26:33.759 --> 26:34.680
Where are the medics?

476
26:34.839 --> 26:35.680
An officer is injured!

477
26:35.720 --> 26:36.319
Hurry!

478
26:37.640 --> 26:38.440
Get him to the hospital, now!

479
26:38.519 --> 26:39.359
Cai Wenxiu, go with him.

480
26:39.480 --> 26:40.759
Report back to me with any updates.

481
26:41.119 --> 26:41.599
Got it. Hurry!

482
26:46.160 --> 26:46.960
The scene is cordoned off.

483
26:47.039 --> 26:47.839
Investigation is underway.

484
26:51.920 --> 26:52.839
Lock down the crime scene!

485
26:53.000 --> 26:53.319
Yes, sir!

486
26:57.000 --> 26:57.559
Captain Cheng.

487
26:58.440 --> 26:59.640
Chuang's heading to the hospital.

488
27:01.960 --> 27:03.119
Calling Captain Cheng! Calling Captain Cheng!

489
27:03.759 --> 27:05.000
Found a woman on top of the silo!

490
27:05.119 --> 27:06.000
She has vital signs!

491
27:08.559 --> 27:09.079
Keep watch down here.

492
27:09.440 --> 27:10.119
I'm going up to check.

493
27:10.480 --> 27:10.920
Let's go.

494
27:28.839 --> 27:29.240
Gao.

495
27:29.319 --> 27:30.440
While searching the scene,

496
27:30.480 --> 27:31.160
we found this person.

497
27:37.359 --> 27:38.160
What are you doing here?

498
27:42.000 --> 27:43.599
I'm the one who called Officer Han.

499
27:44.400 --> 27:45.079
Where is he?

500
27:45.640 --> 27:46.200
What did you say?

501
27:48.880 --> 27:50.319
I called Officer Han.

502
27:52.640 --> 27:53.559
You called him?

503
27:58.640 --> 27:59.240
She can't leave.

504
28:00.319 --> 28:02.079
Track her movements.

505
28:02.200 --> 28:03.680
Check her chat history.

506
28:03.680 --> 28:04.480
Call logs.

507
28:05.240 --> 28:06.400
And the card in her camera.

508
28:06.400 --> 28:08.200
Take it out and check every single second!

509
28:08.799 --> 28:09.440
Give me the camera.

510
28:11.160 --> 28:11.880
Hand it over!

511
28:30.640 --> 28:31.880
Doctor, how is he doing?

512
28:32.079 --> 28:33.200
He's not out of danger yet.

513
28:33.200 --> 28:34.079
He's still under observation.

514
28:35.559 --> 28:37.599
Is his life in any danger?

515
28:37.680 --> 28:38.480
Don't panic. Just wait a little longer.

516
28:39.200 --> 28:40.200
Roughly how long?

517
28:41.480 --> 28:42.279
It's hard to say.

518
28:45.720 --> 28:46.720
Please do everything you can.

519
29:02.799 --> 29:03.279
Hello?

520
29:04.759 --> 29:05.319
Go ahead.

521
29:05.960 --> 29:06.920
We have to wait a few more hours...

522
29:07.039 --> 29:08.400
...to know if she'll be okay.

523
29:08.720 --> 29:09.839
How are things on your end?

524
29:11.799 --> 29:12.279
All right.

525
29:13.319 --> 29:14.880
Tell me right away if anything comes up.

526
29:14.880 --> 29:15.640
I'll head right over.

527
29:16.160 --> 29:16.640
Appreciate it.

528
29:17.240 --> 29:17.680
Bye.

529
29:19.680 --> 29:20.799
How's Tu Chunyan?

530
29:23.119 --> 29:24.160
How is she?

531
29:24.839 --> 29:26.319
How is Tu Chunyan?

532
29:31.079 --> 29:31.960
No comment.

533
30:16.160 --> 30:17.400
Wh-Who are you?

534
30:17.920 --> 30:18.440
Wait a second!

535
30:18.480 --> 30:18.920
The director isn't in!

536
30:19.000 --> 30:19.880
What are you doing?

537
30:20.640 --> 30:21.400
The director isn't here!

538
30:21.759 --> 30:22.200
Director!

539
30:22.480 --> 30:23.279
Well, isn't this Chunyan?

540
30:23.640 --> 30:24.279
It's fine. Head on out.

541
30:24.400 --> 30:25.359
What's going on here?

542
30:25.640 --> 30:26.359
Good grief!

543
30:26.559 --> 30:28.319
Qian Yichuan got beaten up!

544
30:29.680 --> 30:30.960
Th-That really happened?

545
30:30.960 --> 30:31.559
Never mind that.

546
30:31.559 --> 30:32.160
Was it...

547
30:32.319 --> 30:32.960
the Security Section?

548
30:33.000 --> 30:33.920
It was them, wasn't it?

549
30:34.440 --> 30:36.000
Security Section? The Security Section?

550
30:37.279 --> 30:38.240
Oh, my god!

551
30:38.319 --> 30:39.839
There's even blood everywhere!

552
30:41.640 --> 30:42.759
Is he all right?

553
30:43.880 --> 30:45.000
Look at your face, covered in blood!

554
30:45.119 --> 30:46.400
What on earth happened?

555
30:46.799 --> 30:47.759
Where is he? Where's he at?

556
30:48.160 --> 30:49.240
Stop playing dumb!

557
30:49.839 --> 30:51.359
You set those thugs on him!

558
30:52.000 --> 30:53.079
It's just the two of us in here.

559
30:53.400 --> 30:54.799
Stop putting on an act for me!

560
30:55.000 --> 30:55.559
Chunyan...

561
30:55.559 --> 30:56.880
Why are you talking so reckless?

562
30:57.279 --> 30:58.279
Look at you, such a pretty girl,

563
30:58.319 --> 30:59.079
with blood all over your face.

564
30:59.079 --> 30:59.519
It ruins your looks.

565
30:59.519 --> 30:59.960
Come here, come on.

566
31:00.000 --> 31:00.680
Wipe it off, wipe it off.

567
31:01.839 --> 31:04.000
You must give me a straight answer today!

568
31:05.039 --> 31:05.680
Oh, boy...

569
31:06.200 --> 31:07.079
You're gonna pay!

570
31:07.119 --> 31:08.960
You have to pay Qian's medical bills!

571
31:09.119 --> 31:10.519
Otherwise, I'm not leaving!

572
31:13.519 --> 31:14.079
Don't, don't, don't.

573
31:14.079 --> 31:14.839
Calm down, calm down.

574
31:14.839 --> 31:15.559
Let's talk this through slowly.

575
31:15.680 --> 31:16.160
All right?

576
31:17.160 --> 31:17.759
Have some water.

577
31:20.839 --> 31:22.119
Look, about this factory...

578
31:22.160 --> 31:23.480
I've been running it pretty well.

579
31:23.720 --> 31:25.720
Then Qian Yichuan riled everyone up,

580
31:25.720 --> 31:27.720
and a whole crowd started making trouble.

581
31:28.079 --> 31:30.279
As if they'd suffered some huge injustice.

582
31:31.559 --> 31:33.559
I didn't do anything to cross them!

583
31:34.319 --> 31:34.720
Here, here, here.

584
31:34.720 --> 31:35.279
Drink up, have some water.

585
31:37.000 --> 31:39.240
Let me show you something.

586
31:39.440 --> 31:40.240
Come, take a look at this.

587
31:43.720 --> 31:45.279
This is the layoff list.

588
31:45.680 --> 31:46.640
Look closely.

589
31:46.720 --> 31:47.319
Are you on it or not?

590
31:48.480 --> 31:49.319
Are you on here?

591
31:51.720 --> 31:53.079
Aren't you doing just fine?

592
31:53.160 --> 31:54.440
I didn't get you laid off, did I?

593
32:00.279 --> 32:01.319
Hear me out.

594
32:02.079 --> 32:03.079
This Lapi Brewery...

595
32:03.400 --> 32:04.160
is our home,

596
32:04.920 --> 32:06.559
and everyone's gotta take care of it.

597
32:07.920 --> 32:08.880
The brewery's Restructuring,

598
32:09.519 --> 32:11.680
so some folks definitely gotta go.

599
32:12.279 --> 32:13.400
And as for the ones who leave,

600
32:13.599 --> 32:14.559
I never said I'd leave them hanging.

601
32:15.559 --> 32:17.079
Didn't we set up night training classes

602
32:17.119 --> 32:18.079
to teach everyone stuff like

603
32:18.759 --> 32:20.079
zipper repair,

604
32:20.519 --> 32:21.680
bike repair,

605
32:21.799 --> 32:22.839
and then massage,

606
32:22.839 --> 32:23.559
and foot baths?

607
32:23.839 --> 32:24.799
We've got all those classes, don't we?

608
32:25.720 --> 32:27.000
Haven't I done enough?

609
32:28.400 --> 32:29.160
Chunyan,

610
32:29.720 --> 32:31.480
you're such a good-looking girl,

611
32:32.200 --> 32:33.400
and you're sharp as a tack.

612
32:33.599 --> 32:34.680
Just work hard here at the brewery.

613
32:34.720 --> 32:35.960
You've got a bright future ahead.

614
32:36.200 --> 32:37.319
Why are you messing around

615
32:37.400 --> 32:38.920
with that crowd?

616
32:39.880 --> 32:41.079
Why waste your time with that nonsense?

617
32:43.119 --> 32:44.480
You're not getting any younger.

618
32:46.440 --> 32:48.119
Are you seeing

619
32:48.559 --> 32:49.680
Qian Yichuan, huh?

620
32:51.119 --> 32:52.440
That guy's no good.

621
32:52.440 --> 32:53.759
At your age,

622
32:54.240 --> 32:55.759
it's easy to misjudge people,

623
32:56.000 --> 32:56.519
you know?

624
32:56.680 --> 32:57.559
He's a nobody.

625
32:57.960 --> 32:59.440
If he ever becomes a boss someday,

626
33:00.440 --> 33:01.880
he definitely won't want you anymore.

627
33:01.880 --> 33:02.440
Got it?

628
33:02.960 --> 33:04.160
If he doesn't want you,

629
33:04.519 --> 33:05.640
I want you!

630
33:06.960 --> 33:07.640
I want you.

631
33:09.720 --> 33:11.119
Holy crap!

632
33:15.279 --> 33:16.119
You filthy pervert!

633
33:16.160 --> 33:17.160
Ow, Jesus!

634
33:18.759 --> 33:19.640
You filthy pervert!

635
33:19.680 --> 33:21.160
I'll kill you, you hear me?!

636
33:21.319 --> 33:21.960
I'll kill you!

637
33:22.839 --> 33:23.480
Ow, my God!

638
33:24.240 --> 33:24.839
Holy crap!

639
33:25.920 --> 33:27.240
That's enough! Cut it out!

640
33:27.400 --> 33:28.960
Believe me, I'll kill you!

641
33:29.440 --> 33:30.200
Ow, damn it!

642
33:30.400 --> 33:31.240
Let me tell you,

643
33:31.359 --> 33:32.519
you're laid off, you hear me?!

644
33:32.519 --> 33:33.359
If you keep this up—

645
33:33.400 --> 33:34.160
That's enough already!

646
33:34.279 --> 33:35.519
I'm not afraid of you!

647
33:35.640 --> 33:38.079
Security! Security! Security!

648
33:38.559 --> 33:39.559
Security!

649
33:39.720 --> 33:40.519
Security!

650
33:40.640 --> 33:41.559
Drag her out of here!

651
33:43.480 --> 33:44.480
You filthy pervert!

652
33:44.559 --> 33:45.319
Assaulting factory leadership!

653
33:45.319 --> 33:46.319
I'll kill you! You won't get away with this!

654
33:46.720 --> 33:48.880
I'll kill you!

655
34:11.760 --> 34:12.719
Qian Yichuan!

656
34:14.199 --> 34:15.039
Qian Yichuan!

657
34:18.480 --> 34:19.239
Qian Yichuan!

658
34:20.880 --> 34:21.480
Oh, man.

659
34:21.760 --> 34:23.519
I knew you'd be sitting by the river.

660
34:25.599 --> 34:27.000
Why are you looking so handsome today?

661
34:27.599 --> 34:28.440
You're not wearing glasses.

662
34:29.760 --> 34:30.920
Usually when you wear them,

663
34:31.000 --> 34:31.719
blinking your eyes all the time,

664
34:31.760 --> 34:32.599
you don't look handsome at all.

665
34:33.000 --> 34:34.000
You look better without them.

666
34:34.599 --> 34:36.079
You had those for so many years anyway.

667
34:36.079 --> 34:37.599
If they're broken, we'll buy a new pair.

668
34:39.679 --> 34:41.239
Look at the good food I brought you.

669
34:42.079 --> 34:42.719
You have it.

670
34:43.000 --> 34:43.719
I'm not hungry.

671
34:44.320 --> 34:45.639
A buddy just treated me to barbecue.

672
34:49.079 --> 34:50.000
Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

673
34:50.079 --> 34:50.880
It's really delicious.

674
34:53.599 --> 34:54.679
After catching up with you,

675
34:55.519 --> 34:57.079
I have to head over to the paper mill.

676
35:02.599 --> 35:03.639
What's your rush?

677
35:03.719 --> 35:05.000
Your leg hasn't fully healed yet.

678
35:05.199 --> 35:05.800
Take it easy.

679
35:06.880 --> 35:07.719
I'm not in a rush,

680
35:09.079 --> 35:09.840
they are.

681
35:10.920 --> 35:12.320
So many good jobs are waiting for me,

682
35:12.320 --> 35:13.480
I have to sift through them carefully.

683
35:19.000 --> 35:19.760
How are you doing?

684
35:31.960 --> 35:33.159
I'm doing just fine.

685
35:34.400 --> 35:36.599
Plenty of jobs are fighting over me too.

686
35:37.239 --> 35:38.320
I'm in no rush.

687
35:38.840 --> 35:40.320
I've got to sift through them carefully

688
35:40.920 --> 35:42.960
and pick one that pays well.

689
35:47.440 --> 35:48.679
Give me a break.

690
35:50.679 --> 35:52.639
I heard you on the phone with your aunt.

691
35:53.639 --> 35:55.320
Do you know how hard it is to find work?

692
35:55.719 --> 35:56.719
Nobody's hiring anywhere.

693
36:01.960 --> 36:02.719
If they don't want me, fine.

694
36:02.840 --> 36:03.599
Suits me fine.

695
36:04.320 --> 36:05.559
Even tigers take naps,

696
36:05.559 --> 36:07.199
and even bears hibernate for the winter.

697
36:07.920 --> 36:09.599
Who works in the dead of winter anyway?

698
36:09.599 --> 36:10.840
I don't even want to go outside.

699
36:11.239 --> 36:11.880
It's the perfect time

700
36:12.000 --> 36:12.800
to get some rest.

701
36:14.440 --> 36:15.760
Once this winter passes,

702
36:15.880 --> 36:16.800
the snow melts,

703
36:16.840 --> 36:17.719
and it warms up,

704
36:18.239 --> 36:20.400
I'll go sell cracked corn porridge

705
36:20.519 --> 36:21.360
and tea eggs.

706
36:22.960 --> 36:25.079
Cao Jun already set up a tea egg stand

707
36:25.800 --> 36:26.760
and started selling them.

708
36:29.039 --> 36:30.119
I looked into it.

709
36:31.840 --> 36:34.320
You only make 9.5 cents per egg.

710
36:35.320 --> 36:36.320
That's less than a dime.

711
36:37.960 --> 36:39.360
Can you even sell a hundred a day?

712
36:41.079 --> 36:42.480
Look around our factory.

713
36:43.079 --> 36:45.320
Five tea egg stalls every 100 meters.

714
36:47.280 --> 36:47.840
Besides,

715
36:49.840 --> 36:51.000
I used to work in the admin office.

716
36:52.159 --> 36:53.079
How can I go compete

717
36:53.079 --> 36:54.480
with forklift drivers for business?

718
36:55.480 --> 36:56.719
What's so special about the admin office?

719
36:58.079 --> 36:59.639
Don't you still have to make a living?

720
37:03.440 --> 37:04.400
Look at you.

721
37:05.519 --> 37:06.119
The cushy jobs?

722
37:06.119 --> 37:06.960
Nobody's offering them to you.

723
37:07.599 --> 37:08.239
Heavy labor?

724
37:08.239 --> 37:09.159
You can't handle that either.

725
37:10.159 --> 37:10.960
What's wrong with you?

726
37:12.559 --> 37:13.920
Look at the situation we're in.

727
37:16.000 --> 37:17.599
You still can't let go of your pride.

728
37:24.400 --> 37:25.360
How about this?

729
37:26.679 --> 37:27.320
Why don't

730
37:28.639 --> 37:29.920
we head down south?

731
37:31.119 --> 37:33.800
It's freezing here with all this snow.

732
37:34.320 --> 37:35.159
We'll go down south,

733
37:35.639 --> 37:36.880
face the ocean,

734
37:37.480 --> 37:38.760
and enjoy the warm spring.

735
37:39.440 --> 37:41.320
We can hustle and start a small business.

736
37:41.719 --> 37:43.960
Who knows, we might become big bosses

737
37:44.239 --> 37:45.320
and get rich.

738
37:45.719 --> 37:46.440
Right, Boss Qian?

739
37:47.079 --> 37:47.800
I'll just latch onto you then.

740
37:47.800 --> 37:48.519
I'll live off a big shot.

741
37:48.559 --> 37:49.960
Boss Qian, Boss Qian, Boss Qian!

742
37:54.159 --> 37:55.320
Oh man, it's freezing!

743
37:56.199 --> 37:57.599
Why is it so cold this winter?

744
38:17.519 --> 38:18.199
What are you doing?

745
38:29.639 --> 38:30.760
I have a bachelor's degree.

746
38:32.119 --> 38:32.880
What about you?

747
38:35.400 --> 38:36.199
Vocational school, right?

748
38:38.280 --> 38:39.079
I

749
38:39.880 --> 38:41.199
can recite pi

750
38:41.239 --> 38:42.639
to 270 decimal places.

751
38:43.159 --> 38:43.800
And you?

752
38:44.920 --> 38:46.400
You can barely flick an abacus.

753
38:49.840 --> 38:51.039
What are you getting at?

754
38:52.000 --> 38:52.800
What am I getting at?

755
38:55.119 --> 38:56.079
What I'm saying is,

756
38:58.199 --> 38:59.440
I don't think we're a match.

757
39:06.239 --> 39:07.960
So let's not waste each other's time.

758
39:11.840 --> 39:12.400
That's it.

759
39:53.840 --> 39:54.559
Xiao Tu.

760
39:56.679 --> 39:57.519
What are you doing here?

761
40:02.519 --> 40:03.800
Who upset you this time?

762
40:07.320 --> 40:07.760
Here...

763
40:08.239 --> 40:09.000
Have a candied hawthorn.

764
40:09.559 --> 40:11.079
Something sweet will make it all pass.

765
40:11.239 --> 40:11.880
Everything'll be fine.

766
40:13.280 --> 40:13.840
Take it.

767
40:22.960 --> 40:24.440
It's filthy. It got so dirty.

768
40:24.559 --> 40:25.440
Can't eat it now.

769
40:27.639 --> 40:29.280
Anyway, I traded leftover tea eggs

770
40:29.320 --> 40:30.360
with the vendor for it.

771
40:32.000 --> 40:33.159
I'll buy you a fresh one tomorrow.

772
40:39.119 --> 40:40.519
I know you're hurting inside.

773
40:45.519 --> 40:47.079
With Old Qian's leg like this,

774
40:47.599 --> 40:48.599
who could feel good about that?

775
40:51.599 --> 40:52.760
But you've got to have hope.

776
40:53.800 --> 40:54.880
His leg will definitely get better.

777
40:56.119 --> 40:56.920
Take me, for example.

778
40:57.320 --> 40:59.320
I knew nothing besides driving a forklift.

779
40:59.599 --> 41:00.920
Now I sell tea eggs

780
41:01.320 --> 41:02.480
and do deliveries on the side.

781
41:03.000 --> 41:03.960
I don't make much money,

782
41:04.000 --> 41:05.360
but I'm getting by.

783
41:05.400 --> 41:06.280
Doing pretty well, actually.

784
41:08.480 --> 41:09.599
Even I can manage.

785
41:09.760 --> 41:11.679
And Old Qian's way more talented than me,

786
41:12.079 --> 41:12.679
with so much skill.

787
41:12.679 --> 41:13.760
So in the future,

788
41:14.440 --> 41:15.239
the sky's the limit for him.

789
41:22.320 --> 41:23.639
Tu... Xiao Tu.

790
41:25.159 --> 41:26.519
Can I ask you a question?

791
41:27.440 --> 41:28.360
G-Go ahead.

792
41:29.079 --> 41:31.000
What body part fears the cold least?

793
41:34.440 --> 41:35.480
Right, you looked at me.

794
41:35.639 --> 41:36.440
You're smart.

795
41:36.519 --> 41:38.000
It's the eyes that don't fear the cold.

796
41:39.320 --> 41:40.719
One Hundred Thousand Whys says

797
41:41.000 --> 41:42.199
that the human eyeball

798
41:42.199 --> 41:43.360
is made of the conjunctiva,

799
41:43.440 --> 41:44.960
cornea, and sclera.

800
41:45.559 --> 41:47.360
These layers have all sorts of nerves,

801
41:47.440 --> 41:49.519
except for temperature receptors.

802
41:49.679 --> 41:51.880
That's why our eyes never feel the cold.

803
41:57.400 --> 41:58.119
Xiao Tu.

804
41:59.159 --> 41:59.960
I think

805
42:00.480 --> 42:03.639
sometimes we should learn from our eyes.

806
42:04.760 --> 42:05.920
We shouldn't fear the cold either.

807
42:10.840 --> 42:11.480
Cao Jun.

808
42:13.800 --> 42:15.840
Are you always this carefree?

809
42:18.719 --> 42:20.559
Your wife walked out on you years ago.

810
42:21.360 --> 42:22.719
Don't you resent her at all?

811
42:24.280 --> 42:25.360
Why resent her?

812
42:25.760 --> 42:27.079
Look at the mess I've made of myself.

813
42:27.119 --> 42:28.079
As long as she's doing better than me,

814
42:28.079 --> 42:29.119
isn't that better than anything else?

815
42:29.480 --> 42:30.079
Right?

816
42:32.280 --> 42:33.239
What do you think of me?

817
42:34.199 --> 42:34.920
You're pretty great.

818
42:37.920 --> 42:39.360
When you first came to the admin office,

819
42:40.000 --> 42:41.199
you couldn't take your eyes off me.

820
42:41.639 --> 42:42.679
Don't think I didn't notice.

821
42:45.360 --> 42:46.360
N-No, that's not...

822
42:46.480 --> 42:47.079
I... I...

823
42:47.119 --> 42:47.679
Xiao Tu...

824
42:47.719 --> 42:48.800
Do you like me?

825
42:54.079 --> 42:55.000
I do.

826
42:55.199 --> 42:55.800
No, no, wait...

827
42:55.840 --> 42:56.760
Tomorrow is Little New Year.

828
42:57.719 --> 42:58.639
Let's spend it together.

829
43:02.800 --> 43:03.440
Sure.

830
43:03.639 --> 43:04.239
Just say it...

831
43:04.280 --> 43:04.920
Yes.

832
43:07.599 --> 43:08.280
Good.

833
43:20.519 --> 43:21.199
Cao Jun.

834
43:22.159 --> 43:23.639
I'll come to your place tomorrow night.

835
43:29.360 --> 43:30.079
All right.

836
44:06.039 --> 44:06.760
Give it to me.

837
44:07.119 --> 44:07.599
Zhao Haipeng.

838
44:11.159 --> 44:12.400
Why did you even come back?

839
44:13.760 --> 44:15.280
Nothing good happens when you're back.

840
44:15.880 --> 44:16.760
Tell me,

841
44:18.000 --> 44:20.199
when I found Ma Guowen cooking the books,

842
44:20.599 --> 44:22.039
if I hadn't exposed him...
